# perish-bap

Industrial-grade Branch-and-Price for multi-item **perishable lot-sizing**:

- FEFO dynamic programming pricing (Önal et al., 2015)
- Shortest-path fallback
- MIP pricing (handles branching)
- Order/no-order branching on y[i,t]
- Dual-price stabilization
- Column-generation early-stop and global gap stop

⚠️ Requires **Gurobi (gurobipy)** at runtime for the RMP and MIP pricing.

## Install

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e .
```

## Run

```bash
perish-bap run examples/instance_small.json --out results --seed 0
```

Generate a random instance:

```bash
perish-bap make-instance --items 5 --periods 40 --out examples/instance_auto.json
perish-bap run examples/instance_auto.json --out results
```

## Cite

Önal, Romeijn, Sapra, van den Heuvel (2015), EJOR 244(3):881–891.
